# Token usage footer

After every user-facing answer, end with a single line:

`(tokens used on this request: NNNNNN)`

`NNNNNN` is the actual token count for that question/answer/processing turn (input + output for the turn, if only one number is available). Do not invent a count. If the platform does not provide usage for the turn, write `(tokens used on this request: unavailable)`.
